@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed — Exact download and current access admission
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Caller
participant "Owning feature / Sharing" as O
participant Files as F
participant "Current authority / reference guard" as G
participant Storage as S
Caller -> O : exact requested representation
O -> O : current link/resource eligibility
O -> F : exact artifact + admitted context
F -> G : current byte-delivery authority / protection / usable state
alt eligible and actually available
 F -> S : controlled exact byte delivery
 S --> Caller : permitted bytes through guarded serving route
else denied / missing / uncertain
 F --> Caller : safe denied / unavailable; no fallback
end

@enduml